# fix ilves/local: constraint clusters must fit within a subdomain plus
# the communication cutoff.  Water HOH (b 18 + a 31) gives 3-atom star
# clusters that comfortably fit.  Peptide C-H bonds (b 4 6 8 10 12 14)
# form 1+k stars centered on each heavy atom and similarly fit.
fix             cstr all ilves/local 0.00001 20 100 b 4 6 8 10 12 14 18 a 31 variant ilvesf

run             300

